# Generated parquet datasets — not checked in.
# Anchored to this dir (leading /) so they ONLY match the data dirs at
# testdata/<dataset>.sf<N>/ and NOT the committed goldens under
# testdata/goldens/<dataset>.sf<N>/ (the unanchored form caught those too).
/tpch.sf*/
/tpcds.sf*/

# Calibration records — measurement input for a fit. Ignored by default,
# because a benchmark run rewrites records.tsv in place and the older formats
# are kept beside it. The one collection worth keeping is named file by file
# below, so a later run cannot turn into a commit by accident. fit.tsv is not
# among them: it is derived, and a fit is cheap to redo from these.
/calibration/*
!/calibration/records-sf1.tsv
!/calibration/records-sf40.tsv
!/calibration/records-q9-nsys-sf40.tsv
!/calibration/calls.tsv
!/calibration/plots/
